OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1787564895
OL,3,CJeff Bezos consortium's stake in
OL,4,CLiverpool larger than initial deal
OL,6,FThe consortium led by Amazon founder
OL,7,FJeff Bezos now owns a bigger slice of
OL,8,FLiverpool Football Club than initially
OL,9,Fbelieved.
OL,11,FNew details reveal the group holds a
OL,12,F38% share, much closer to 40% than the
OL,13,Fpreviously suggested "around 30%".
OL,15,FSources say the consortium, operating
OL,16,Funder the name 1892 Holdings and
OL,17,Fheaded by British-Indian businessman
OL,18,FAmit Bhatia, also has an option to
OL,19,Fpurchase a controlling stake in
OL,20,FLiverpool within the next 12 months.
OL,26,@uD@VOUuD@aO]
