PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1787564895
OL,3,CJeff Bezos consortium's stake in
OL,4,CLiverpool larger than initial deal
OL,6,FHowever, this is not a formal
OL,7,Fcommitment, and both sides have
OL,8,Fstressed there is no guaranteed plan
OL,9,Ffor an outright takeover.
OL,11,FThe investment, which values Liverpool
OL,12,Fbetween $5 and $6 billion, was not
OL,13,Fdriven by financial necessity for the
OL,14,Fclub's majority owners, Fenway Sports
OL,15,FGroup (FSG).
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
