PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1787564895
OL,3,CJeff Bezos consortium's stake in
OL,4,CLiverpool larger than initial deal
OL,6,FInstead, FSG saw the involvement of
OL,7,FBhatia, Bezos (through K5 Sports),
OL,8,FFacebook co-founder Eduardo Saverin,
OL,9,Fand Saverin's wife Elaine as a major
OL,10,Fopportunity to bring in world-class
OL,11,Fbusiness expertise.
OL,13,FThe new expanded board will include
OL,14,Frepresentatives from K5 Sports and EE
OL,15,FCapital, Saverin's family office.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
