OL,3,CJeff Bezos consortium's stake in
OL,4,CLiverpool larger than initial deal
OL,6,FBhatia, who is also the son-in-law of
OL,7,FIndian steel magnate Lakshmi Mittal
OL,8,Fand a former co-owner of QPR, will
OL,9,Ftake on the role of Liverpool's new
OL,10,Fvice-chairman after serving as FSG's
OL,11,Fkey partner throughout negotiations.
OL,13,FDespite the size of the deal,
OL,14,FLiverpool's immediate transfer plans
OL,15,Fand budget are not expected to change.
OL,17,FThe club's current sporting and
OL,18,Ffinancial strategy will continue to be
OL,19,Fled by its existing operations team.
